#: src/configuring-the-shell.md:1
msgid "Configuring the Shell"
msgstr ""

#: src/configuring-the-shell.md:3
msgid ""
"There are a number of ways to configure the shell for shell recipes, which "
"are the default when a recipe does not start with a `#!` shebang. Their "
"precedence, from highest to lowest, is:"
msgstr ""

#: src/configuring-the-shell.md:7
msgid ""
"The `--shell` and `--shell-arg` command line options. Passing either of "
"these will cause `just` to ignore any settings in the current justfile."
msgstr ""

#: src/configuring-the-shell.md:9
msgid "`set windows-shell := [...]` (deprecated)"
msgstr ""

#: src/configuring-the-shell.md:10
msgid "`set windows-powershell` (deprecated)"
msgstr ""

#: src/configuring-the-shell.md:11
msgid "`set shell := [...]`"
msgstr ""

#: src/configuring-the-shell.md:13
msgid ""
"Use the `[windows]` and `[unix]` attributes with `set shell` to use "
"different a shells on Windows."
msgstr ""
